- Sub-TLVs

The BorderRouter TLV has:
- `sizeof(NetworkDataTlv)` = 2 bytes (type + length)
- `length` bytes of entries

So the total size of the Prefix TLV is `sizeof(NetworkDataTlv) + prefixLengthBytes + sizeof(BorderRouterTlv) + length`.

