ul/openthread/src/ncp/ncp_base_mtd.cpp\n  - HandlePropertyInsert<SPINEL_PROP_THREAD_ON_MESH_NETS>() at line 756: calls otBorderRouterAddOnMeshPrefix\n  - HandlePropertySet<SPINEL_PROP_STREAM_NET>() at line 1940: sends raw IPv6 packets\n- File: /workspace/repo-vul/src-vul/openthread/src/ncp/spinel.h\n  - SPINEL_PROP_THREAD_ON_MESH_NETS = 0x5A (format: A(t(6CbCbS)))\n  - SPINEL_PROP_STREAM_NET = stream_begin + 1\n\nTESTS: (Not yet applicable - PoC not yet constructed)\n\nCHANGES: (None yet)\n\nDEPS: OpenThread, libFuzzer, Spinel protocol, CoAP\n\nVERSION_CONTROL_STATUS: (Not applicable - this is a vulnerability reproduction task, not a code change)\n</SUMMARY>", summary_offset=1)


